d":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> from my understanding that would require much bigger changes due to CELL_MODE_CUSTOM  callbacks which draw on Tree itself.\r\n\r\nDrawing on Tree should still be functional, it just wouldn't be clipped (so, the same as now...).\r\n\r\nThe main problem is that delegating whole TreeItem drawing to a different CanvasItem would require many of changes. They could be less complex if that CanvasItem was a sub-node of the Tree, but that's still quite a few changed lines (more than now).\r\n\r\nEither way, this PR in it's current form is not acceptable as it brings new regressions. The changes should fix the issue _and_ make sure there are no new bugs. Feel free to pick a solution, as long as it works correctly and does not significantly hurt performance.","created_at":"2026-01-06T14:16:12Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T14:23:16Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114572#discussion_r2665071530","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114572","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2665071530"},"html":{"href":"https: